#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/cli.rst:125
msgid "恢复中断的实验"
msgstr "Resuming Interrupted Experiments"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/cli.rst:127
msgid "实验会在每步结束时原子地写出 checkpoint。即使进程在写入过程中崩溃，已有 checkpoint 也不会被破坏："
msgstr ""
"The experiment writes checkpoints atomically at the end of each step. Even if the "
"process crashes during a write, the existing checkpoint is not corrupted:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/cli.rst:129
msgid ""
"``run_dir/SOCIETY.json`` —— 初始化时写一次，保存不可变的全量配置，例如 ``agent_specs``、 env 模块类型和 "
"kwargs、``batch_size``、``steps_hash``。"
msgstr ""
"``run_dir/SOCIETY.json`` -- written once during initialization. It stores immutable "
"full-run configuration such as ``agent_specs``, env module types and kwargs, "
"``batch_size``, and ``steps_hash``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/cli.rst:131
msgid "``run_dir/SOCIETY_STEP.json`` —— 每步标量：当前时间、步数、已完成的顶层步数、``terminated``。"
msgstr ""
"``run_dir/SOCIETY_STEP.json`` -- per-step scalars: current time, step count, "
"completed top-level step count, and ``terminated``."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/cli.rst:132
#, python-brace-format
msgid "各 env 模块的状态写到 ``run_dir/env/{module_type}/state/ENV_STATE.json``，具体格式由模块自定。"
msgstr ""
"Each env module writes its state to "
"``run_dir/env/{module_type}/state/ENV_STATE.json``. The module chooses the concrete "
"format."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/cli.rst:134
msgid "用 ``--resume`` 从最后完成的步续跑："
msgstr "Use ``--resume`` to continue from the last completed step:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/cli.rst:136
msgid ""
"python -m agentsociety2.society.cli \\\n"
"    --config hypothesis_1/experiment_1/init/init_config.json \\\n"
"    --steps hypothesis_1/experiment_1/init/steps.yaml \\\n"
"    --run-dir hypothesis_1/experiment_1/run \\\n"
"    --resume \\\n"
"    --log-file hypothesis_1/experiment_1/run/output.log &"
msgstr ""
"python -m agentsociety2.society.cli \\\n"
"    --config hypothesis_1/experiment_1/init/init_config.json \\\n"
"    --steps hypothesis_1/experiment_1/init/steps.yaml \\\n"
"    --run-dir hypothesis_1/experiment_1/run \\\n"
"    --resume \\\n"
"    --log-file hypothesis_1/experiment_1/run/output.log &"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/cli.rst:145
msgid ""
"恢复时以 checkpoint 中的 env 模块类型和 kwargs、时钟、步数为准，而不是重新读取 config 文件中的这些值，这可以避免配置漂移。``RunStep`` "
"会根据游标跳过已完成的部分；``Ask``、``Intervene`` 和 ``Questionnaire`` 会重新执行。如果 ``steps.yaml`` 的 hash 与 "
"checkpoint 不一致，CLI 会输出 WARNING。可以用下面的命令校验恢复点："
msgstr ""
"On resume, the checkpointed env module types and kwargs, clock, and step counts take precedence "
"over the config file. This avoids configuration drift. ``RunStep`` skips completed work according"
" to the cursor; ``Ask``, ``Intervene``, and ``Questionnaire`` run again. If the ``steps.yaml`` "
"hash does not match the checkpoint, the CLI prints a WARNING. You can inspect the restore point "
"with:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/cli.rst:149
msgid "cat hypothesis_1/experiment_1/run/SOCIETY_STEP.json   # step_count / completed_step_count"
msgstr "cat hypothesis_1/experiment_1/run/SOCIETY_STEP.json   # step_count / completed_step_count"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/cli.rst:155
msgid ""
"只有覆盖了 ``to_workspace()`` 和 ``restore()`` 的 env 模块才能在 resume 时恢复动态状态（见 :doc:`env_modules`）。未覆盖的模块 "
"resume 后会回到 fresh 态。"
msgstr ""
"Only env modules that override ``to_workspace()`` and ``restore()`` can restore dynamic state "
"during resume; see :doc:`env_modules`. Modules that do not override them start in a fresh state "
"after resume."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/cli.rst:160
msgid "配置文件"
msgstr "Configuration Files"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/cli.rst:161
