msgstr "``init_config.json``"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/cli.rst:165
msgid "初始化配置文件定义实验的基本设置："
msgstr "The initialization configuration file defines the basic settings of the experiment:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/cli.rst:165
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"    \"agents\": [\n"
"        {\n"
"            \"agent_id\": 1,\n"
"            \"agent_type\": \"PersonAgent\",\n"
"            \"kwargs\": {\n"
"                \"id\": 1,\n"
"                \"profile\": {\"name\": \"Alice\", \"personality\": \"friendly\"}\n"
"            }\n"
"        }\n"
"    ],\n"
"    \"env_modules\": [\n"
"        {\n"
"            \"module_type\": \"SimpleSocialSpace\",\n"
"            \"kwargs\": {\n"
"                \"agent_id_name_pairs\": [[1, \"Alice\"]]\n"
"            }\n"
"        }\n"
"    ],\n"
"    \"codegen_router\": {\n"
"        \"final_summary_enabled\": false\n"
"    }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"    \"agents\": [\n"
"        {\n"
"            \"agent_id\": 1,\n"
"            \"agent_type\": \"PersonAgent\",\n"
"            \"kwargs\": {\n"
"                \"id\": 1,\n"
"                \"profile\": {\"name\": \"Alice\", \"personality\": \"friendly\"}\n"
"            }\n"
"        }\n"
"    ],\n"
"    \"env_modules\": [\n"
"        {\n"
"            \"module_type\": \"SimpleSocialSpace\",\n"
"            \"kwargs\": {\n"
"                \"agent_id_name_pairs\": [[1, \"Alice\"]]\n"
"            }\n"
"        }\n"
"    ],\n"
"    \"codegen_router\": {\n"
"        \"final_summary_enabled\": false\n"
"    }\n"
"}"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/cli.rst:193
msgid ""
"``codegen_router`` 块可选。``final_summary_enabled`` 自 v2.10.0 起**默认关闭**：关闭时 env ``ask`` "
"的最终应答由确定性拼装生成；开启后每次 ask 额外产生一次 LLM summary 调用，会增加调用开销；是否开启取决于是否需要自然语言总结。"
msgstr ""
"The ``codegen_router`` block is optional. ``final_summary_enabled`` has been **off by"
" default** since v2.10.0: when off, the final environment ``ask`` response is "
"assembled deterministically. Enabling it adds one LLM summary call per ask; use it "
"when a natural-language summary is needed."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/cli.rst:197
msgid "steps.yaml"
msgstr "steps.yaml"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/cli.rst:199
