msgstr ""
"{\n"
"    \"pid\": 12345,\n"
"    \"status\": \"running\",\n"
"    \"start_time\": \"2026-03-20T10:30:00\",\n"
"    \"experiment_id\": \"1_1\",\n"
"    \"simulation_time\": \"2026-01-01T02:00:00\",\n"
"    \"step_count\": 2\n"
"}"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/cli.rst:266
msgid ""
"``status`` 为 ``running`` / ``completed`` / ``completed_with_errors`` / "
"``failed``；每个步骤结束时会更新进度字段（``simulation_time`` / ``step_count``），完成或失败时追加 ``end_time``，失败时附带 "
"``error``；``--resume`` 续跑时附带 ``resumed`` / ``resumed_from_step``。"
msgstr ""
"``status`` is ``running`` / ``completed`` / ``completed_with_errors`` / ``failed``; progress "
"fields (``simulation_time`` / ``step_count``) are updated at the end of each step, ``end_time`` "
"is appended on completion or failure, ``error`` is attached on failure, and ``resumed`` / "
"``resumed_from_step`` are attached when continuing with ``--resume``."

